                    request.expectedDraftVersion(), nowMs());
            if (updated == 0) {
                throw ApiException.conflict("DRAFT_VERSION_CONFLICT",
                        "草稿版本不符，期望 " + request.expectedDraftVersion());
            }
            newVersion = request.expectedDraftVersion() + 1;
